WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:06.747
"The Risks and Benefits
of Chondroitin for Osteoarthritis"

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:11.100
Chondroitin is a structural
component of cartilage

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.840
commonly used
as a dietary supplement

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.320
for osteoarthritis
that shares a similar story

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.760
with glucosamine.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.600
There's a large heterogeneity
in outcomes,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.460
with the industry-funded studies

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.380
showing a benefit
for symptomatic relief

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.980
and the non-industry-funded
studies showing no effect,

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.220
with a small effect size
similar to glucosamine.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.340
Considering just the largest,
best-run studies,

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.080
the benefit of chondroitin
was found to be

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.760
"minimal or nonexistent"

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.460
and its use "therefore
be discouraged."

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.320
Like glucosamine,

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.420
the current American College
of Rheumatology guidelines

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.680
"strongly recommend against"

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.500
the use of as chondroitin
for knee or hip osteoarthritis,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.920
along with the American Academy
of Orthopedic Surgeons

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.320
and Osteoarthritis Research
Society International,

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.180
whereas the European Society

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:59.040
for Clinical
and Economic Aspects

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.720
of Osteoporosis,
Osteoarthritis,

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.600
and Musculoskeletal Diseases
again allow

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.700
for the use
of pharmaceutical-grade,

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.220
prescription-only chondroitin.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.380
Chondroitin is
typically extracted

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.860
from animal cartilage-
shark fins, bovine,

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.620
and chicken windpipes,
or pig noses-

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.440
and slaughterhouse
supply chains

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.960
are not known for their "good
manufacturing practices."

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.560
The lack of purity
and presence of contaminants

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.680
is blamed in part for the lack
of consistent reproducibility.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.620
A study of 32 chondroitin
supplements on the market

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:34.020
found that only five
contained the labeled amount,

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.760
and some contained none.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.240
Terms like "quality tested"
or retail price

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.120
were found to provide no basis
for judging quality.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.200
Some of the cheapest

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.840
and the most expensive
chondroitin on the market

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.600
contained less than 10 percent
actual chondroitin.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.300
When the National
Institutes of Health

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.820
set out to design
the esteemed GAIT trial,

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.640
the Glucosamine/Chondroitin
Arthritis Intervention Trial,

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.700
they ruled out
20 different commercial products

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.040
for issues like quality control
before giving up

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.380
and just deciding to have it
specially made themselves.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.260
More than 1500 patients

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.480
with symptomatic
knee osteoarthritis

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.500
were randomized to take

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.280
standard daily doses
of glucosamine, chondroitin,

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.380
both glucosamine
and chondroitin,

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.600
an NSAID
anti-inflammatory drug,

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.000
or a placebo for six months.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.080
Only the drug beat out placebo
for pain management.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.240
Neither glucosamine
and chondroitin alone

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.060
or in combination
reduced pain effectively,

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.940
and neither did it have
any significant effect

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.520
on delaying disease progression
on X-ray.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.700
Chondroitin also failed
in a two-year study,

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.160
but two other trials
found that by year two

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.780
objective benefits
could be found,

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:45.840
and a third using
more sensitive imaging (MRI)

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.820
could pick up
protective effects

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:48.720
by six months.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.160
If you want to give it a try,

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.440
there's now
a purified non-animal source

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.820
of chondroitin
made from scratch

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.920
that should be free
of contaminants.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.940
In the U.S., chondroitin
and glucosamine

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:02.520
are almost always sold
in a combination pill.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:05.880
Like in the GAIT trial,
a meta-analysis of studies

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.920
pitting both
against osteoarthritis

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.620
found no clinically significant
benefit.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:14.220
However, there had
never been a trial

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.960
in which pharmaceutical-grade,

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.140
prescription-only preparations
of both were used together

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:23.160
until finally
one was published in 2017.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:25.260
The multicenter
randomized, double-blind,

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.640
placebo-controlled
clinical trial

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.320
had to be stopped prematurely

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.920
because one group was doing
so much better than the other

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.960
that it was deemed unethical
to continue.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.660
See how much more
one of the treatments

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.680
was reducing pain?

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:42.540
But that superior treatment
was the placebo!

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.960
Unexpectedly,
when the code was broken,

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.900
it turned out that
the placebo group did better!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.160
In other words,

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.980
the industry-funded study
found that their own

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:55.200
pharmaceutical-grade
chondroitin/glucosamine

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.480
was making the pain
significantly worse

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.980
compared to a sugar pill.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.560
In the sugar pill group,
47 percent had

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.940
at least a 50 percent
improvement

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.660
in pain or function,

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.160
compared to just 28 percent

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.200
in the chondroitin/glucosamine
group.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:10.800
What the chondroitin/glucosamine
users did get

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.360
was more side effects,

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.980
such as diarrhea
and abdominal pain;

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.320
so, doctors may want
to tell their patients

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.840
to stop taking their glucosamine
and chondroitin

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.600
as it is less effective
than placebo.

